Nginx Web Server Setup

Nginx was used as the web server for this project. 
Nginx is suitable for hosting a static HTML website because it is lightweight, reliable and commonly used on Linux servers.
To check whether Nginx was running, I used:

sudo systemctl status nginx

The output showed:

Active: active (running)

This confirmed that the Nginx web server was running successfully.
Other useful Nginx commands used during the project were:

sudo systemctl start nginx

sudo systemctl restart nginx

sudo systemctl enable nginx

sudo nginx -t

The sudo nginx -t command was used to test the Nginx configuration for syntax errors before restarting the web server.
